WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.293
It all must make sense.

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:04.838
There has to be a reason.
Things don’t just happen.

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:20.478
When the finale of season two ends,
you’re left with this girl who has

00:00:20.478 --> 00:00:23.189
kind of bested this
scary, mythic figure.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:26.609
Vanity is a sin, Aunt Josephine.

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:30.321
And she’s sitting there on
the bed and says, you know,

00:00:30.321 --> 00:00:32.615
I know what’s gonna happen.
I know they’re coming for us.

00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:37.662
We pick up three months later
and Leanne is in the middle of

00:00:37.662 --> 00:00:39.247
absolute paranoia.

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.666
I told you that we
can’t trust strangers.

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:46.588
She’s anticipating an attack
that hasn’t happened yet.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:49.007
You ready for food, buddy?
Num num time.

00:00:49.007 --> 00:00:53.553
On the surface you really get a
sense that the family’s doing well.

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:55.138
I thought you’d wanna see this.

00:00:57.432 --> 00:00:58.600
Oh look!

00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:02.812
I think the family has been
lulled into thinking, we made it.

00:01:02.812 --> 00:01:06.191
I think that everything’s happening
the way that it’s supposed to.

00:01:07.275 --> 00:01:08.651
Don't worry.

00:01:08.943 --> 00:01:13.239
And Dorothy’s very grateful
that she has her child back.

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:19.329
She’s very sympathetic to Leanne
as a teenage member of a cult.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:25.293
But can you leave the church?
Can you leave this cult?

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:30.423
I just want to understand what
you believe. That’s all. 

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:35.512
When Leanne starts exhibiting darker
tendencies and destructive choices…

00:01:35.804 --> 00:01:38.932
Believe me, I am frightened
about what she might do next.

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:41.601
Dorothy has a realization
that she’s dealing with 

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:43.728
someone really, really unstable.

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:45.438
Boo.

00:01:46.314 --> 00:01:49.943
Each character in the family
has their own point of view

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:51.069
about what’s happening.

00:01:51.069 --> 00:01:53.863
Sean believes that this is a miracle,

00:01:53.863 --> 00:01:56.491
and Leanne is the instrument of that.

00:01:56.491 --> 00:01:59.494
I still can’t believe we’re here,
on the other side of it.

00:02:00.495 --> 00:02:05.500
Julian is a person that struggles
with addiction in many forms, 

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.670
and in this season his
addiction is Leanne.

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:13.508
Leanne continually starts
to surprise herself,

00:02:13.508 --> 00:02:17.303
and her realization of
how powerful she is

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:21.432
grows to a scary
and very dark place.

00:02:22.183 --> 00:02:23.393
God won’t fix you.

00:02:25.186 --> 00:02:28.731
There’s a defiant part of
her that’s going to emerge,

00:02:28.731 --> 00:02:32.944
and it will get kind of scary
when she’s pushed too far.

00:02:34.195 --> 00:02:35.613
I’m doing this for you.

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:40.869
The fans of Servant will find
that we found our stride.

00:02:41.911 --> 00:02:43.746
The story kind of
keeps unfolding and

00:02:43.746 --> 00:02:46.082
you’re gonna learn more
and more about the mystery,

00:02:46.082 --> 00:02:48.251
the things you’ve been
waiting to hear about.

00:02:48.251 --> 00:02:50.879
And there’s so many
shocks and surprises,

00:02:50.879 --> 00:02:53.339
there’s life and death
in every single episode.

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:56.634
Season three should leave
your jaw hanging open.

